This Terraform configuration creates an AWS Kinesis Firehose Delivery Stream using an extended S3 destination. It provisions:

- An S3 bucket to receive delivered records
- An IAM role assumed by Kinesis Firehose
- An IAM policy granting Firehose permission to write to the S3 bucket
- A Kinesis Firehose Delivery Stream configured with `extended_s3_configuration`

